# Microinteractions

Every action should provide feedback.

## Surfaces

Buttons, cards, forms, tabs, uploads, downloads, messages, voice, GPS, payments, jobs.

## Motion rules

- Subtle, fast, smooth, consistent  
- Prefer ≤150–200ms (`duration-fast` / `--duration-fast`)  
- Always honor reduce-motion (`usePrefersReducedMotion` + `html.reduce-motion`)  
- Press: `.btn-press` / `PRESSABLE` — one scale language (`0.97`), no stacked scales  
- Success: `toast.success` / `SuccessCheck` / `.success-pop`  
- Errors: `toast.error`  
- In-flight: disable control + label (“Saving…”)  
- Haptics: `haptic()` for primary ops only (PTT, shift, delivery) — never under reduce-motion  

## Definition of done

Incomplete if a primary action has no press/disabled/toast feedback, or animations ignore reduce-motion / exceed ~200ms without reason.
